# Regression tests

When changing PHP under `modules/php/` (cards, composites, states, Game/Theah paths they exercise), run the local suite before finishing:

```
php tests/run.php
```

- Suites: `tests/regression/<expansion>/*_Test.php` (`core`=01, `tac`=02, `faf`=03, `bas`=04, `cad`=05, `framework`=`StatesTrait`/`FrameworkActions`/`ArgumentsTrait`/`DeckTrait`/`EventHub`/`Theah`/`UtilitiesTrait`); non-card suites live directly in `tests/regression/`
- Currently covers `_01006`–`_01206`, `_02001`–`_02061`, faction `_03001`–`_03073` and `_04001`–`_04060`, city-deck `_03cd01`–`_03cd21` and `_04cd01`–`_04cd29` and their Action/Reaction/Technique/Maneuver composites, and a partial `cad` set of named `_05*` cards (BoyBand, DabneyUS01, Dandy, Gary/GaryFlipped, Hulk, Sniper, Teapot, Teens, Volk)
- If you change a covered card/composite, run at least that suite (or the full runner)
- If you add/fix behavior that should not regress, extend or add a suite under `tests/regression/`
